{"unit_id":"LLYlab__DSHEssentialTools#card-zh","repo":"LLYlab/DSHEssentialTools","commit":"76beca9f603c4c906ebb305944de004dc366f9c0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-essential-tools 是面向 DSH Web 的常驻插件，提供工程工作区工具、图像处理和按需装载能力。入口接入 ALV、ADU 与客户端界面：ALV 可给图片加栅格标尺、提取边线坐标、裁切增强并执行 OCR；ADU 可列出、查看和装载工具模块。适合在 DSH 中处理工程文件、检查图片并按任务选用工具的开发者。工程路径及部分 Windows 能力取决于本机配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:524-538","lib/alv.js:243-280","lib/adu.js:110-127"]}
{"unit_id":"LLYlab__DSHEssentialTools#card-en","repo":"LLYlab/DSHEssentialTools","commit":"76beca9f603c4c906ebb305944de004dc366f9c0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-essential-tools is a DSH Web plugin for workspace and image tools. ALV adds grids, extracts edge coordinates, enhances images, and runs OCR. ADU lists, describes, and loads tool modules as needed. It helps developers inspect images and project files; some features require local paths or Windows.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:524-538","lib/alv.js:243-280","lib/adu.js:110-127"]}
