{"unit_id":"LLYlab__DSHEssentialTools#feature-image-grid","repo":"LLYlab/DSHEssentialTools","commit":"76beca9f603c4c906ebb305944de004dc366f9c0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-essential-tools 的功能「图片几何辅助」：图片几何辅助：为图像添加栅格、边缘标尺与指定辅助线，帮助模型按坐标定位内容。通过 alv_grid 工具输入图像路径和网格参数，输出带坐标参考的图像。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/alv.js:277-318"]}
{"unit_id":"LLYlab__DSHEssentialTools#feature-image-ocr","repo":"LLYlab/DSHEssentialTools","commit":"76beca9f603c4c906ebb305944de004dc366f9c0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-essential-tools 的功能「图像文字识别」：图像文字识别：从图片识别文字，也可配合行列坐标逐格读取表格并返回文字结果。通过 alv_ocr 提供图像与可选单元格区域。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/alv.js:403-436"]}
{"unit_id":"LLYlab__DSHEssentialTools#feature-adu-load","repo":"LLYlab/DSHEssentialTools","commit":"76beca9f603c4c906ebb305944de004dc366f9c0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-essential-tools 的功能「工具模块按需装载」：工具模块按需装载：列出可用模块、查看模块内工具说明，再选择模块装载。通过 adu_list、adu_describe 与 adu_load 完成选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/adu.js:274-377"]}
